#: src/modules/Clientfence/SignInSecurity.php
msgid "The country of your address (:ip) is not known, so this would lock you out. Add your address to the staff IP address list first."
msgstr "無法判定您的位址 (:ip) 所屬的國家/地區，因此這會把您鎖在外面。請先將您的位址新增到員工 IP 位址清單。"

