#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_settings.html.twig
msgid "Turn tickets off when you use another help desk: clients and visitors then open, reply to and email no tickets, and the ticket pages, menus and boxes are hidden. The tickets you have are kept and come back when you turn tickets on. The knowledge base and network status have their own switches."
msgstr "若您使用其他服務台，請停用支援單：客戶與訪客將無法開立、回覆或以電子郵件寄送支援單，支援單頁面、選單與區塊也會隱藏。現有的支援單會保留，並在您重新啟用支援單後恢復。知識庫與網路狀態有各自的開關。"

#: src/modules/Support/templates/admin/mod_support_settings.html.twig
