msgstr "請先儲存 ClientExec 資料庫詳細資料。"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Saved cards, two-factor sign-in, coupons, package add-ons, ticket attachments and refunds: the warnings name what was found."
msgstr "已儲存的卡片、雙重驗證登入、優惠券、套餐附加元件、支援單附件和退款：警告會列出找到的內容。"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "The import reads ClientExec's database directly and only reads it: it copies what it needs into a private file on this server, then imports that file with the steps below. Nothing changes in ClientExec. The password is kept encrypted and is not shown again; leave it empty to keep the saved one."
msgstr "匯入會直接讀取 ClientExec 的資料庫，而且只讀取：它把所需內容複製到本伺服器上的私人檔案，再以下列步驟匯入該檔案。ClientExec 中不會有任何變更。密碼會加密保存，不會再次顯示；留空即可保留已儲存的密碼。"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Import.php
msgid "This database has no ClientExec tables. Check the database name."
msgstr "此資料庫中沒有 ClientExec 資料表。請檢查資料庫名稱。"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
